<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<b style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-align: center;"><span style="line-height: 19.6px; color: rgb(0, 102, 149); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="" size="4">Congratulations on Your First Payroll</font></span></b><br><blockquote style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 15.4px;"><b><span style="line-height: 19.6px; color: rgb(0, 102, 149); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></span></b></p></blockquote></blockquote><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;">Now that we’ve achieved this important milestone together, we would like to provide you with quick access to resources that we believe will be of great value. We will work together to schedule one-on-one training on many of these topics.&nbsp;In the meantime, feel free to access the links below for ease of reference.</span><br><blockquote style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p></blockquote></blockquote><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; transition-duration: 0.1s; transition-timing-function: linear; transition-property: color; cursor: pointer;"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/help_center"><font color="#3333ff">Insperity Premier Help Center</font></a></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(91, 155, 213); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;</span><font color="#181818" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">– This site offers user training videos, user guides and brief tutorials designed to assist with topics that include navigating Insperity Premier, managing new or existing employees, and much more!</font><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; transition-duration: 0.1s; transition-timing-function: linear; transition-property: color; cursor: pointer;"><a href="https://service.insperity.com/service-technology/YourInsperityInvoice/NIR/story_html5.html">Insperity Payroll Reporting</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;–&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;">Access the “Payroll Reports” tab on this page for a brief video on how to run reports via Insperity Premier.</span></div><div style=""><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;">Additionally,<a href="https://service.insperity.com/service-technology/WebReporting/data/downloads/NSP_Index_of_Reporting_Templates.pdf">&nbsp;</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; transition-duration: 0.1s; transition-timing-function: linear; transition-property: color; cursor: pointer;"><a href="https://service.insperity.com/service-technology/WebReporting/data/downloads/NSP_Index_of_Reporting_Templates.pdf">this link</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;directs you to a helpful resource with samples and descriptions of each Insperity report.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; transition-duration: 0.1s; transition-timing-function: linear; transition-property: color; cursor: pointer;"><a href="https://service.insperity.com/service-technology/YourInsperityInvoice/NIR/story_html5.html">Your Insperity Invoice</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;– Access this page for guidance on understanding your Insperity payroll invoice and additional reporting tutorials.</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div style="text-align: center;"><font color="#181818" face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></div></blockquote></blockquote><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;">I am available as your trusted payroll partner and look forward to providing support.&nbsp;Feel free to reach out should you need any assistance regarding your payroll-related concerns.&nbsp;</span><br><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><span style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></blockquote></blockquote><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;">Thank you for choosing Insperity!</span><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></p></blockquote><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p></p></blockquote></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></span></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Kind Regards,&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="4" face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">{!Contact.Name}</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Payroll Specialist</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">{!Contact.NSP_Work_email__c}</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font style="" face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">{!Contact.NSP_Work_Phone__c}</font></span></p></div></div>]]></td>
